{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sQD5p5uAcbXiqDz1xvlTmA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.549741+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sQD5p5uAcbXiqDz1xvlTmA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3ru4dTvqwSv42IRmiaf2veFqF87dMlhyFwsPLGSJ8Jic9F9wYwnBZz0wQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3taNOG21OskWdAsezsicMxsG0aEAtAOU0zk5qLqGtP9Yu1dOQElhkh0A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南京理工大学微电子学院（集成电路学院）由南京理工大学、中国电子科技集团有限公司和南京市人民政府联合共建，旨在服务国家战略需求，凝聚优势力量，培养高水平拔尖创新人才，助力国家集成电路等产业高质量发展。</span></p><p><span>学院拥有“电子科学与技术”一级学科，2005年获批一级学科博士授权点，2011年、2016年、2021年入选江苏省重点学科，2013年入选工信部两化融合类重点学科，2023年入选江苏省高校优势学科（应用转型类）；二级学科“电磁场与微波技术”是1981年国家首批硕士学位授权学科，2007年入选国家重点学科，2008年、2016年入选国防特色学科。设有物理电子学、电路与系统、微电子学与固体电子学、电磁场与微波技术、新一代电子信息技术（量子方向）、集成电路工程等硕士专业；设有电子科学与技术、电子信息等博士专业。</span><span><strong><span>所有学生均在南京校区培养</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>学院坚持产教融合、科教融汇、国际融通的人才培养战略。获批集成电路与集成系统工信部校企协同育人基地、电磁计算与射频感知江苏省高校国际合作联合实验室、江苏省外国专家工作室。拥有近程射频感知芯片与微系统教育部重点实验室、电磁仿真与射频感知工业和信息化部重点实验室等省部级以上科研平台，入选全国先进半导体行业产教融合共同体副理事长单位，为学校国家卓越工程师学院工程师技术中心。学院实行“双导师制”，由中国电科的首席科学家、首席专家等高层次人才与学院专任教师共同担任导师，开设校企共建专业和课程，构建适应产业发展需求的课程体系、实验平台和实习实践基地体系，培养集成电路领域拔尖创新人才。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3cI4kic5WKzdp08JuLVpklq64fic0W7jb88IuzWQgLA7uYIyib3mtTkECQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3taNOG21OskWdAsezsicMxsG0aEAtAOU0zk5qLqGtP9Yu1dOQElhkh0A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>参加人数：</span><span><strong><span>100人</span></strong></span><span>左右</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年07月10日-07月24日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2026年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业与微电子学院招生专业相近，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，成绩优异，外语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；学科竞赛、科研训练已取得优良成绩者优先；已获得与招生专业相近的学术成果者优先；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，由微电子学院（集成电路学院）根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过学院网站公示。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>将以下材料</span><strong><span><span>扫描电子版按顺序合成一个PDF文件</span></span></strong><span>，并将其命名为：姓名-学校-专业，于</span><strong><span><span>7月24日</span></span></strong><span>前发送至邮箱yz132@njust.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span>（1）南京理工大学校园开放日活动申请表（在报名系统中填写后生成）；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证和身份证扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（3）个人简历：包括个人科研经历和成果的总结，感兴趣的研究方向、及对我院相关研究领域、方向和导师的了解等，200字以内；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科阶段成绩（院系或教务处盖章）及英语水平证明扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（5）其他证明材料扫描件（如科研论文、获奖证书等）。</span></p><p><span>【注：以上申请材料如有弄虚作假，一经发现立即取消相应资格。】</span></p><p><span>报名截止后，学院将对申请者提供的材料进行审核，并于</span><strong><span><span>7月25日</span></span></strong><span>之前对报名邮件进行回复。入选人员须在收到录取邮件之日起</span><strong><span><span>2日内回复邮件</span></span></strong><span>确认是否参加，逾期未回复者视为自动放弃资格，名额由候补申请者递补。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>开放日活动时间为</span><strong><span><span>2025年8月25日</span></span></strong><span>，期间将组织学院和学科介绍、政策宣讲答疑、专家学者讲座、学院导师交流等活动。具体活动以学院设置为准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3xlxSohloLxK2ovjdZfWpCE1nhjU0xgjVsmZRzHKiaFeA4jKefiaJcFlQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：钟老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：025-84315751</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：yz132@njust.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>报名人员加QQ群：624726561</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3TW9xQmR85ODXN7fbFT7xeLNM3Jp2UPqA8ibe4uuTzQA8VHlC87FNFsA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3pz4mt11ONdsTLedyPm286gFOuwg6UtDordPmDiaA59LWEibSSc31DMDg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 微电子学院（集成电路学院）</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 代芳冰</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华  </span><span>微电子学院（集成电路学院）</span></p><p><span>审核 | 齐玉辉</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"0a920f2f5828deaf7fde11be344433cd27de244354b1491e0dfe61e67e3fb05d","textLength":1616,"sourceSha256":"710110329bd112b94d931839886904e0ff2935bb7c07aae4d4b910a61aad6080","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bc418b94f731b59743a1","title":"2025年南京理工大学微电子学院（集成电路学院）2025年校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.549741+00:00"}
